Reason: Compose ColorScheme has reference equality; two separately generated identical palettes must be compared by all 48 color roles, including fixed roles and deprecated surfaceVariant. Keep independent createSeedColorScheme expectations, the non-raw-primary check, and expand the same method to both light/dark, 2021/2025 specs and two unrelated standard styles. No product colors or completeness test changes.

